#176238=PRODUCT('PRT - 9040 - CAMTARXIA - V04',
'PRT - 9040 - CAMTARXIA - V04',
'Beam target for the XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense, chassis: slides into an open
UC2 cube, two rigid rails on -x seat on the 45 deg edge chamfers (x, z
); two long flexure arms on +x click into the +x chamfers, two lands o
n -x limit the roll, the stick''s shoulder is the hard stop. Camera bl
ock in a square seat, XIAO from the back, USB-C from the top. Lens tub
e with a jaw and a lock screw for the lens, screwed out of the module.
 PETG, print on the front face, no supports.',(#176233));
#176239=PRODUCT('PRT - 9041 - CAMTARCOV - V04',
'PRT - 9041 - CAMTARCOV - V04',
'Back cover: lies in a recess of the back, tongues press the XIAO forw
ard, the slits are the vents. Three M3 x 10 into Ruthex inserts. Print
 on the back face.',(#176233));
#176240=PRODUCT('PRT - 9033 - CAMTARKEY - V04',
'PRT - 9033 - CAMTARKEY - V04',
'Wedge key: pushed in from the side between the camera module and the 
USB-C shell, clamps the module into its seat. Print on its side.',(#176233));
#176241=PRODUCT('PRT - 9034 - CAMTARSCR - V04',
'PRT - 9034 - CAMTARSCR - V04',
'Screen cap: 0.6 mm printed white screen with a reticle on the inner f
ace, cone-centred, two 8x3 magnets. Print on the screen, white.',(#176233));
